// T-247. Numbers: tune later. `capacity` is the mail it collects per game day (and delivers: the
// same trips), `storage` the vans it has, `tier` 1 = post office. Without power it does not work.
// T-270: 40 vans (was 5): a van's run takes five times more of the day on the movement clock of
// system-design §2 v1.2, and the fuller roads slow it more; 25 vans collected 79 % of a town's
// mail a day, 40 collect what 5 did before (mail_e2e).
Service((
    id: "post_office",
    name: "Post Office",
    kind: Post,
    radius_m: 1200.0,
    capacity: 2400,
    storage: 40,
    tier: 1,
    vehicles: ["mail_van"],
))
